  "note": "DataBinder lives in spring-context; WebDataBinder in spring-web inherits setDisallowedFields, so an app call on either lands here. Present in 4.3.0, 5.3.27 and 6.1.13. Without a disallowed-fields list there is nothing to bypass, so \"not reached\" holds even though isAllowed runs on every bind.",
